      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "clm:a61f5f8b19daf6a317ef7cd68fea205dd148cc3fce79b73ff5ec4bd367203d64",
      "text": "Performance Advisor is available on M10+ clusters; recommendations consider replica-set workload activity including secondaries. (low confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-14)",
      "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/performance-advisor.md",
      "also": [],
      "validation_status": "SUPPORTED",
      "evidence_ids": [
        "ev:7c5a78d34328bc0ca5a484dbe445bc6affd46ce394f3203f571d6b28137080b5"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "clm:603d17b2d5ffb7f4ba0a143609fb1a4fca24c61cb21a282a5490bedcf380f7f7",
      "text": "Suggested-index metrics include execution frequency, average execution time and documents examined per document returned; Impact ranks suggestions by wasted bytes read. (low confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-14)",
      "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/performance-advisor.md",
      "also": [],
      "validation_status": "SUPPORTED",
      "evidence_ids": [
        "ev:dcf8204e4b45f886ee64f1a4a9c8aadf6cc42ad76425962f1f49eb6b3c188f60"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "clm:87502bf51129dc058451244c21c81d8abbf09bae9cc455646767481b9fdb02e5",
      "text": "Before creating another index, weigh its write cost and query frequency, and consider whether existing indexes can serve a modified query. (medium confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-14)",
      "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/performance-advisor.md",
      "also": [
        "https://www.manning.com/preview/mongodb-in-action-third-edition/chapter-21"
      ],
      "validation_status": "SUPPORTED",
      "evidence_ids": [
        "ev:19c82037d86c76a73b50a500e42ae406e77a7313841d23d5c87188e7fe6f6e03"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "clm:7755c7c04d5df13d4b3add40a731a9b59ccc31cc481cbc5f143b330b6d26f97d",
      "text": "Index-suggestion coverage has limits: time-series collections receive no performance suggestions, and extreme log volume can interrupt Atlas log collection for these interfaces; downloadable logs remain complete. (low confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-14)",
      "source_url": "https://www.mongodb.com/docs/atlas/performance-advisor.md",
      "also": [],
      "validation_status": "SUPPORTED",
      "evidence_ids": [
