      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "clm:53ee99cbae04d5cc4a2fee22c748313540fdeef17f78cdc0d364e0a2e248255d",
      "text": "For its own log-based compatibility analysis, AWS documents disabling Atlas threshold management, enabling full logging with db.setProfilingLevel(0, -1), then restoring managed operation afterward; it warns of overhead and recommends dev/test capture. (low confidence) (verified as of 2026-10-30)",
